## v2 — Minimax + baselines (`agents/base.py`, `simple.py`, `minimax.py`, `evaluation.py`)

- `Agent`, `SearchStats`, `RandomAgent`, `GreedyAgent` (takes a win, else blocks, else
  prefers center).
- `MinimaxAgent(depth)` exactly as in ALGORITHMS.md §1, using the **basic** evaluation
